{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver\u2019s seat of this <i>fast</i>, <strong>chaotic</strong>, and skill-driven racing experience, where you play as Carl \u2014 a monkey mailman who\u2019s been late on his deliveries. Fed up with your missed deadlines, your boss has rigged your truck with explosives\u2026 and the timer\u2019s already ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/e4d33c69c352128f309e8abb35df16d5.webp?t=1765270184\" width=214 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is simple... deliver the mail across 18 unique maps before time runs out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/26318db873ec13a6a04db9bda986035b.poster.avif?t=1765270184\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/26318db873ec13a6a04db9bda986035b.webm?t=1765270184\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/26318db873ec13a6a04db9bda986035b.mp4?t=1765270184\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/4b0461e6f110e36ff395fad5e1e7f075.webp?t=1765270184\" width=210 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or with up to 8 players \u2014 invite friends or match with other players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m